7:2-7:7 warning nil_method_call: Variable 'oConn' may be NIL at this point. Calling methods on NIL raises an error.
10:3-10:8 warning nil_method_call: Variable 'oPrev' may be NIL at this point. Calling methods on NIL raises an error.
